          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Hypotheses and analyses were preregistered at AsPredicted.com: https://aspredicted.org/blind.php?x=vw3gq2 (Study 3) and https://aspredicted.org/blind.php?x=de3ws9 (Study 4). Production date: 2013 (study 1), 2018/2019 (study 2), April 2019 (study 3) and August 2019 (study 4). Method: Data was collected by the LISS panel (study 1 and 2), in the SP lab (study 3) and on Prolific Academic (study 2).\nUniverse: Participant were from a representative sample of the Dutch population (study 1 and 2), first year bachelor psychology students (study 3) and participants on Prolific (study 4)."
